WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:03.390
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:03.390
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:09.330
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:09.330
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:19.900
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.840
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.860
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.860
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:27.300
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:27.300
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:31.070
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:31.070
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:35.350
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:35.350
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:38.790
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:38.790
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:45.380
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:45.380
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:49.840
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:49.840
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:49.910
I can say love

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:53.640
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:53.640
It overflows with love.

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:53.640
will you love me?

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:57.250
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:57.250
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.200
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.200
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:03.760
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:03.760
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:08.410
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:08.410
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:32.770
Now that I think about it, I wonder if this area really is uncivilized...

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:36.940
Are you still bothered by what Tennan-sensei told you earlier?

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:39.880
No, not particularly...

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:15.710
You two look like you're having fun...

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:19.280
But there's not even anything that special on Earth...

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:20.920
Earth is great!

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:23.550
I can't believe how many dirty sites this planet's Internet has!

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:25.920
Hey! Check her out! This is amazing!

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:28.830
Everyone has their own expectations of Earth, don't they?

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:32.160
We've lost sight of why we even came back here...

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:35.890
Now that I think about it, I wonder how Tennan-sensei is doing...

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:39.540
How humiliating!

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:42.370
I'm covered in dirt and there's not even a shower here!

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:44.580
To think that I have to live like this...

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:46.940
Hey! New guy! Stop yer slackin'!

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:50.610
If ya wanna bath, then go dig yerself a hot spring!

00:02:57.190 --> 00:02:58.060
A hot spring!

00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:00.620
--It sure looks like one! 
--Wow!  A hot spring!

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:02.030
Why...?

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:08.000
Homecoming

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:10.970
It's a pleasure to meet you, sir and ma'am.

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:13.570
My name is Ryoko Balouta!

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:15.040
I'm Amane Kaunaq.

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:19.710
Both publicly and privately,

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:23.850
Seina-kun and I are in the middle of a deep relationship!

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:26.950
--Oh, you're really too kind!
--Oh, you're really too kind!

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:28.380
--To think that I would get 
--To think that I would get

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:30.590
--to meet his parents...! 
--to meet his parents...!

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:33.590
These girls are hot, hot, hot...!

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:36.060
Knock that off you guys...!

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:37.060
A distress signal?

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:39.900
Oh, gimme a break! Not at a time like this...!

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:43.920
Their first impression of me depends on how amiable I come across!

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:46.940
Distance, 17900!

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:50.440
Captain. A passenger ship is being attacked by pirates!

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:51.610
Let's go to its aid immediately!

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:52.180
Yes, sir.

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:53.870
Dammit...!

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:56.310
And the Earth's right there, too!

00:03:56.310 --> 00:04:00.050
What foolish pirates would dare interrupt us with a raid at a time like this?!

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:02.980
Coordinates confirmed. Initiating hyperspace jump!

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:12.430
Filthy pirates! I don't got time to waste on you!

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:17.300
The oceans of the infinite porno-net await me!

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:19.660
Rajau.

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:22.070
Did something pass by just now?

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:23.540
Just your imagination.

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.910
Anyway, which do you want, soy sauce or soy flour?

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:26.840
Mayonnaise!

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:28.040
Wow!

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:40.590
It looks like he's all right.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.260
He doesn't seem to have any serious injuries,

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:44.590
and I don't detect any physical anomalies either.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:48.560
So there's nothing strange, huh?

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:51.170
I've also matched him with an entry in the genetic database.

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:53.970
He was indeed a passenger aboard the ship that was attacked.

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:56.210
So there was only one survivor...

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:57.440
Terrible, isn't it...

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:00.980
It's miraculous enough that anyone survived at all.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:02.310
That's true.

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:05.680
At any rate, let's take him to the nearest GP outpost.

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:13.290
Oh, good! You're conscious!

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:16.380
Everything's okay now!  Don't worry!

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:23.170
It's all right, don't be afraid...

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.730
Is he scared because he saw you, Ryoko?

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:27.460
No, he took one look at you and...

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:42.950
Give me a break! What's so scary about this outfit?!

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:46.520
Well, it certainly doesn't make you look like a GP officer, that's for sure...

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:49.090
I'll have you know this is a specially designed Kaunaq dress!

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:51.030
Huh? What's wrong, Seina?

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:55.630
My house was a store, and my parents were always busy...

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:57.730
All kinds of things would happen whenever I was around...

00:05:57.730 --> 00:06:01.730
So Kiriko-san looked after me when I was a little boy.

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:29.030
Oh... What's the matter? You can't sleep?

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:33.670
Transmission from the bio-droid!

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:36.370
He's successfully captured Seina Yamada and the rest of the crew!

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.610
The guild's very latest technology is amazing!

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:40.580
Good. Bring them in at once.

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:41.540
Understood!

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.760
Alright. Bring down the prisoners.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:17.110
Check. There is no mistake.

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:34.030
At last you're mine.

00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:35.120
And...

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:41.940
Do you remember this?

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:47.930
I left it there so I wouldn't forget to get revenge on you... Seina Yamada.

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:52.480
I'll first start by repaying the favor.

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:55.180
In a single moment, with no time for suffering!

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:03.420
What's going on...?

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.690
It turned out just like we expected.

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:37.060
The alternate crew androids proved useful.

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:41.230
They certainly did. Washu-sama, the Kamidake's creator, is a true genius!

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:42.730
To think she could make such convincing holograms

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:44.570
with our personal data alone...

00:08:44.570 --> 00:08:48.940
Yeah, but how did you know that boy was a spy?

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:50.970
Intuition.

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:53.940
That's right. Fuku told us too.

00:08:54.710 --> 00:08:57.010
But was it alright to do something like that so suddenly?

00:08:57.010 --> 00:09:00.520
It's called retribution and getting one's just desserts.

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:05.150
And besides, we were ordered to destroy the Daidalos on sight anyway.

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:09.610
We had no choice. They injured prisoners who didn't put up any resistance.

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:13.030
But what if there were other captives onboard...

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:17.170
Aside from the crew and aides, no one ever stays alive on the Daidalos.

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:19.870
So that's why we were ordered to destroy it on sight.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:23.930
Well, we've already lost a lot of time, but let's hurry to Earth!

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.540
Is the serious part over already?

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:27.700
Too short.

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:32.820
So Tarant wasn't enough after all.

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:33.820
Correct, sir!

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:36.020
We aren't watching them at the moment,

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:38.390
but it appears the Kamidake is headed for Earth.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:40.190
I leave it in your hands.

00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:42.590
Anyway, what is the status of our special fleet?

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:45.900
It's still in the testing stages, but it's performing far beyond expectations!

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:47.930
It will be useable!

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:50.800
An eye for an eye, a tooth for a tooth...

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:56.010
Yoshiko... Yoshiko...

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:58.910
It's been such a long time... Yoshiko...

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.110
Lucky!

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:02.240
Okay!  Here goes!

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:05.980
I wish for a handsome boyfriend!

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:08.510
Alright! I said it!

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:18.990
Ecstasy!

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:22.400
Oh, I thought I was gonna die for a second there...

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.870
We're really standing out...

00:10:57.870 --> 00:10:59.300
Don't look up!

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:02.970
We have no idea what people will say if they recognize us!

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.610
Hey!

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:06.610
--Kai!
--Hey, Seina!

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:07.710
Hey, Kai!

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:09.850
Huh?  My big sis is with you too?

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:14.080
--Heard you were having a costume parade, so we all came to see! 
--What do you mean, Huh?!

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.850
But aren't you alone, Kai?

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.150
Everyone's over there!

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:25.060
--Hey, Seina! 
--Good to have you back!

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:26.960
Why are they so far away?

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:31.730
Don't look so down in the dumps! They all wanna see you!

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:34.540
And besides, you can't blame 'em...

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:35.600
Kai!

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:37.670
...because this is what happens.

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:38.800
Sorry.

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:40.050
Yamada

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:50.620
Welcome back, Seina!

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:53.220
I-I'm home...

00:11:53.220 --> 00:11:54.420
--It's a pleasure to meet you! 
--It's a pleasure to meet you!

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:56.820
--My name is Amane Kaunaq!
 --My name is Ryoko Balouta!

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:58.860
Get over here!

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.100
How dare you try to interrupt a reunion

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:03.330
--between a son and his parents!
--What an amazing house...

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:06.320
So the store makes this much money when I'm not around...

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:14.580
Well, it is big, but it's thanks to all the money you've sent!

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:16.310
Eh? Money I've sent...?

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:21.780
Um, well, the truth is that you're receiving a fleet commander's salary.

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:24.250
Then there are bonuses for being a decoy too...

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:25.620
B-but...!

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:28.960
I'm sorry for not telling you. But since you're still a student,

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:32.260
Airi-sama says it's not good for you to have too much money.

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:34.560
So I've been putting it all into a savings account.

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:35.600
I see...

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:37.770
So you've been sending them money from that...?

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.600
Only the interest.

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:40.590
Eh?!

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:45.370
You've never thought about your own efficiency as a decoy, have you?

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:48.980
Don't worry, when you graduate I'll give it all over to you.

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:51.350
Well, Seina, you must be tired!

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:53.780
There's no need to be polite, come in and relax!

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:56.720
That's right! This is your house, after all!

00:12:56.720 --> 00:13:00.790
Kiriko-chan, ladies, please come in too!

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:03.430
I'm Amane Kaunaq, ma'am.

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:05.960
I'm Ryoko Balouta, ma'am.

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:07.490
They just don't give up...

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:12.000
What're you doing, hurry inside!

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:14.560
Your lovely guest is waiting!

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:18.470
Guest...?

00:13:18.470 --> 00:13:21.770
I hear you helped take her home the other day...

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:27.040
That's right. Big Brother Seina was really nice!

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:28.220
Hey, now...

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:30.590
And you came all this way to thank him for it...

00:13:30.590 --> 00:13:32.250
You're so well-mannered for someone so young!

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:34.150
She's actually 2000 years old.

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:39.800
Oh my, let me get a washrag...

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:42.200
I'm so sorry, ma'am!

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:47.600
What are you doing, Neige-sama?!

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:52.880
I'm in his debt, so isn't it natural to come and thank his parents?

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:55.540
Don't give us that!

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:59.420
And besides, you're in no position to leave anytime you want.

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:02.450
Plus this planet's civilization is still in the early stages of development!

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:04.650
If you say something you shouldn't, it could cause a huge problem!

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:08.490
I'm not Amane-san. I actuallypay attention to what I say.

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:10.090
Don't be dragging other people into this!

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:11.330
Just let it go.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:14.000
In any event, if Melmas found out about this,

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:17.470
not even you could escape punishment, Neige-sama...

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:19.500
My successor has already been chosen.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:23.140
Plus I have a body-double on Melmas, so it's all right!

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:24.840
But Jurai's...!

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:28.640
And besides, it was Seto-sama who brought me here.

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:33.840
That smelly old hag!

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:38.080
There, that's the spot...!

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:42.710
Stay with me! Open your eyes!

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:45.690
Cohen...

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:48.000
I'm... done for...

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:51.430
This is my punishment for falling in love with you, a prisoner...

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:53.540
What are you talking about, Elena?

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:58.010
Cohen... Live... That's all I want...

00:14:58.010 --> 00:14:59.170
Elena...

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:04.250
Elena!

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.370
Cut!

00:15:07.180 --> 00:15:08.950
Okay, rehearsal's over!

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:11.690
Thanks! You were great!

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:17.290
Um... I'm thinking I'd like to help during the real thing too, if possible...

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:22.360
I'm sorry, but the rules say we can't cast non-pirates in pirate TV shows...

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:24.130
I have no problem with becoming a pirate!

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:25.400
Nor do we!

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:28.470
Welcome back, Seina.

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:30.070
I'm back!

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:32.310
Well, let's get this party started!

00:15:32.310 --> 00:15:33.770
Cheers!

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:39.980
So, seriously, where do you live?!

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:43.120
Tokyo? Osaka? Fukuoka?

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:44.520
No, uh...

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:47.260
Oh yeah, it had the kanji for space or something in it...

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:48.560
Forget about it, just eat...

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:50.730
Say, could you introduce me to Ryoko-san or Amane-san or both of them?

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:52.630
--Have some more...
--Thanks!

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:54.390
Just eat.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:16:01.100
To think he would bring back some girls... especially ones this beautiful!

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:04.010
Oh, you...!

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:07.460
Hasn't Seina-dono always been popular with the girls?

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:09.950
Yeah, right!

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:12.920
Kiriko-chan was the only girl who dared be around someone so unlucky!

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:15.680
--Here you are!
--Thanks...

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:18.550
I don't mind his unluckiness one bit!

00:16:20.090 --> 00:16:23.530
We really owe you so much for taking care of him, Kiriko-chan!

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:25.160
Oh no, I haven't done that much...

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:29.230
I bet he's gotten himself into all sorts of situations, hasn't he?

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:31.070
No, not that many...

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:33.940
Don't be like that, you can tell me!

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:37.040
It's so lonely around here now that nothing bad ever happens to anyone!

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:40.270
Don't tell me you actually enjoy his misfortune...

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:43.280
Have some more, sir!

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:44.750
Thanks!

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:48.420
What was Seina-dono like as a child?

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:52.250
An unlucky little runt, o' course!

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:56.090
Yeah, I bet he was!

00:16:56.090 --> 00:16:57.250
Ow...!

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:00.100
Big Brother!

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:03.270
Oh, so this fine, young man is your elder brother?

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:06.370
It's a pleasure to meet you. My name's NB.

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:08.440
What're you doing...?

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:10.060
What's this now?

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:15.210
You're so silly, Fuku-chan...

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:16.610
Where are you going?

00:17:16.610 --> 00:17:18.310
Hey, what was that just now?

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:20.550
Dunno. I picked it up in a rice field.

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:22.120
When did you get here?!

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:23.390
And what's with elder brother?!

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:27.420
In my eyes, Yoshiko-san's elder brother is the same as my elder brother.

00:17:27.420 --> 00:17:29.560
You're too much! You're so naughty!

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:33.230
--Thanks!
--I am truly grateful to Seina-dono.

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:34.160
What for?

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:37.970
He's not only the person who saved my life, but much more!

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:41.870
No, no, he's not that great of a son...

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:44.240
That isn't true, ma'am!

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:46.740
Seina-dono is everything to me!

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:48.680
You're so good at flattery!

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:49.980
I'm telling the truth!

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:56.620
But from the way you're dressed up, Ryoko-san, you look like a princess!

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:59.090
Yes, I'm Balouta's...

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:00.680
I knew it!

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:07.200
Where are you going, Fuku-chan?

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:08.590
Lemme go!

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:11.900
--This thing's really something!
--Why won't you let me go?!  Hey!

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:13.940
--Isn't it, though?
--Do they have lots of these in Tokyo?

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:15.300
No, um...

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:20.480
Amazing! It's even got a tail!

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:23.710
Fuku-chan. Don't be drinking anything you shouldn't.

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:24.510
That's right!

00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:26.280
He did...?

00:18:26.280 --> 00:18:31.310
Ma'am! Seina's the best student I've ever taught!

00:18:32.050 --> 00:18:35.360
Really? We parents wouldn't know about that...

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:36.390
Yes, he is!

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:40.330
Actually, Seina-dono's the only one you've ever taught...!

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:43.730
They're always like this...

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:46.630
So, what exactly do you teach him, Amane-san?

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:50.370
Oh, I give him a lot of special, hands-on training...

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:52.810
Here it comes!

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:54.880
Ready!

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:59.710
--I'm spinning...! Yoshiko-san! Do more!
--Look at him spin!

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:04.750
So pretty!

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:09.390
Amazing! There aren't any pictures of Seina-dono where he's not injured!

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:11.590
And each picture is a different injury...

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:14.860
He was always getting hurt as a boy.

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:18.130
We started taking pictures each time to commemorate each one!

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:20.370
So you really did enjoy his bad luck...

00:19:20.370 --> 00:19:22.000
What's this, ma'am?

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:24.370
I think that's when he fell into a manhole!

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:25.370
What about this one?

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:28.340
That was when he missed his footing on his tricycle's pedals!

00:19:28.340 --> 00:19:30.380
That was the day you bought it, wasn't it?

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:34.850
That's right!  The day you fixed him up and brought him back home!

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:38.250
You've done so much for him ever since then!

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:40.480
That's not true...

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:45.660
He's had so many injuries...

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.260
Falling into the river, falling into rice fields,

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:49.400
tripping four times while on a walk!

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:52.030
Plunging into ditches, falling over on his bicycle,

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:54.600
spraining his ankles on perfectly flat ground...

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:56.910
He certainly did have it difficult...

00:19:56.910 --> 00:20:02.040
The very day he was born the maternity hospital had to shut down.

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:05.610
The shrine we took him to was robbed by thieves after the offering money.

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:07.650
And when we went to the town hall to register his birth,

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:11.920
they couldn't enter his records because of computer malfunctions.

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:14.060
He certainly is at no loss for anecdotes...

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:17.120
So he's been this way since the minute he was born...

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:21.860
There you go, Fuku-chan!

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:23.370
Isn't she cute?

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:24.860
Yeah! Really cute!

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:37.280
Come on, Pops...

00:20:37.280 --> 00:20:38.480
This thing's crazy!

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:40.880
Okay, everyone! Let's play the bomb game!

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:43.940
Hey! I ain't a bomb! I don't go boom!

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:02.800
Beautiful moon, isn't it?

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:08.010
K-Kiriko-san...

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:17.620
It's strange, isn't it?

00:21:17.620 --> 00:21:22.960
It wasn't that long ago when I thought I could never go there.

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:26.260
Now you can go even farther, can't you?

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:28.630
Even farther...

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:33.600
Just how far can I go, I wonder?

00:21:39.570 --> 00:21:42.010
Don't leave me behind...

00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:57.990
Yoshiko-san... What is this?

00:21:57.990 --> 00:22:01.200
This is just a joke, right? You're not really leaving me here, are you?

00:22:01.200 --> 00:22:03.670
I thought we were just starting to hit it off...

00:22:03.670 --> 00:22:05.770
Don't you feel the same way?

00:22:05.770 --> 00:22:07.600
Yoshiko-san? Yoshiko-san?!

00:22:07.600 --> 00:22:10.040
Yoshiko-san...!

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:27.020
You're the worst, most hopeless,
most unlucky boy in all of space...

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:34.890
Even against your will...
(You fail.)

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:36.700
Even when you're gentle...
(You're extremely clumsy.)

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:41.200
With too much fighting spirit,
in vain, it's all coming to nothing...

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:44.190
You're gonna fail.

00:22:45.370 --> 00:22:48.040
Carefully...
(So irritating!)

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:50.040
Or with violence...
(Ow! Quit it!)

00:22:50.040 --> 00:23:01.110
You're the worst and most hopeless...
you're a lost cause.

00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:10.830
You're the worst and the most hopeless...


00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:15.170
You're an unlucky boy...

00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:20.510
But, any way, I'm with you.

00:23:20.510 --> 00:23:25.670
So, more and more,
keep on doing what you do!

00:23:31.590 --> 00:23:34.100
Fuku and I head for Tenchi-senpai's house

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:36.400
to say hello to Washu-chan, her creator.

00:23:36.400 --> 00:23:38.940
Tenchi-senpai, Ryo-Ohki,Washu-san, Sasami-chan,

00:23:38.940 --> 00:23:42.210
Noike-san, Ryoko-san, Ayeka-san,and Mihoshi-san all make appearances!

00:23:42.210 --> 00:23:44.110
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP!

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:45.300
Seina and Tenchi
